# Skyweave2

Rewrite workspace for the Skyweave core. v1 stays untouched as the reference
implementation and golden generator; v2 is scored against the shared golden
artifacts before it replaces behavior.

## Layout

```text
src/skyweave2/contracts/   frozen D0 contracts (see docs/DETECTION_CONTRACTS_D0.md)
tests/contracts/           D0 tests T1-T5, T7
docs/                      specs and decisions
../golden/                 version-neutral goldens + hashes (T6)
```

## Setup

Requires [uv](https://docs.astral.sh/uv/) (`brew install uv`) and nothing
else; uv provides the pinned Python 3.10.

```bash
cd v2
uv sync --extra dev      # creates .venv from uv.lock
uv run pytest            # T1-T5, T7
uv run ruff check src tests
```

The v1 cross-check test (`test_v1_projection_agrees_with_frozen_convention`)
runs only when v1 is importable:

```bash
PYTHONPATH=../v1/src uv run pytest
```

## Golden regeneration (T6)

See `../golden/REGENERATION.md`. OpenCV must be installed; regeneration
without a recorded reason is a process violation.

## Rules

- Contracts change only with a recorded decision in the D0 spec.
- Explicit seeds everywhere; no wall-clock values in scored outputs.
- Python 3.10 pinned (matches the Jetson image).
